{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301092","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301092","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1430109201:1":{"text":"당연하지! 이건 내 기술을 뽐낼 수 있는 절호의 기회야. 칼린, 너는?","source_cn":"我肯定会参加！这可是展现自己技艺的机会。卡尔林，你呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B5EA3323C5BA8A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430109202:1":{"text":"나? 난 모르겠어... 아이언비어드랑 스톤피스트도 참가한다는데.","source_cn":"我？我不知道……我听说铁须和石拳都会参加。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DDDC5810517F467","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430109203:1":{"text":"뭐? 그 둘은 이미 실력이 엄청난데 왜 제련 대회에 참가한다는 거야?","source_cn":"什么？他们的技艺已经那么优秀，哪儿还用得上参加锻魂大赛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5620A8D113F20071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠达因":{"text":"장인 데인","source":"工匠达因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:工匠卡尔林":{"text":"장인 칼린","source":"工匠卡尔林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}